            "title": "Temu-owner PDD Holdings beats profit expectations, outlook uncertain",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "(Reuters) -China's PDD Holdings beat forecasts on Tuesday with a 14% rise in third-quarter adjusted earnings, a sign that the e-commerce group's \u200bsteep discounts and heavy marketing spending bolstered demand in its home market.  Chinese retail majors such as PDD, Alibaba and JD.com have been wooing domestic shoppers with price cuts and billions of dollars' worth of subsidised promotions during a prolonged period of subdued consumer confidence amid job worries and a weak property market.  Those discounts have translated into higher sales, although below PDD's typically \u2060high double-digit rates of previous years.",
